linic | conditional pass pending | `04_storage_update_2026-05-06.md` | Newer update confirms status remains not accepted for first-wave use. |\n| S-201 | South Gate Clinic | certified | `03_storage_audit_2026-04-18.csv` | No newer storage change listed in the 2026-05-06 update. |\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
